    <wu-field multiline-display margin-bottom>
      <span slot="label" class="headtitle">Notes</span>
      <span slot="value" dir="auto"> This consolidated version of December 1, 2017 of the Patents Rules, 2003 takes into account amendments up to Patents (Amendment) Rules, 2017, which entered into force on December 1, 2017.
The said Rules introduced amendments to rule 2, sub-rule (fb) under Chapter I, relating to definition of "Startup" of the consolidated version.

The amendments introduced by the following amending Rules have not yet been incorporated into this consolidated version:
- Patents Amendment Rules, 2019;
- Patents (Amendment) Rules, 2020; and
- Patents (2nd Amendment) Rules, 2020. </span>
    </wu-field>
